UID:44fc1a80f8e9b055c6f6732de477d955@petalumariverpark.org
DESCRIPTION:We’re teaming up with Blue Zones Project Petaluma and Grand 
 Central Petaluma Coffee &amp\; Empanadas to bring you a FREE 10-week Summe
 r Walking Group\, every Thursday morning from June 4-August 6 from 8:45-10
  am! Check-in\, power up with 10% off a coffee\, tea or snack\, and don a 
 complimentary official T-shirt before heading over to the River Park for a
  beautiful walk led by BZPP Ambassadors Paul and Amanda Sheddan and our am
 azing River Park docent volunteers Vasi\, Ellyn\, and Evelina! RSVP now at
  https://www.eventbrite.com/e/blue-zones-project-petaluma-10-week-summer-w
 alking-group-moai-tickets-1984080288553 PLEASE NOTE: In the event of rain\
 , walks will be canceled. Thank you for your understanding. [data-website-
